<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;">Hi <%= @first_name.presence || "there" %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;"><%= @business_name %> is scheduled to be permanently deleted on <strong><%= @due_on.to_fs(:long) %></strong>, as asked. Its clients, quotes, jobs, invoices, payments, files and settings will be removed and can't be recovered.</p>
<% if @suspended %>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;">To get a copy of your data first, or to cancel, write to <a href="mailto:<%= @support %>"><%= @support %></a> before that date.</p>
<% else %>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;">To keep anything, download it from Settings → Your data before then. To cancel, write to <a href="mailto:<%= @support %>"><%= @support %></a> before that date.</p>
<% end %>
